    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d171">

                <pb facs="0272" n="188" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg188"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Beaupré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-24"><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President will make no engagement as to his action on the canal matter, but I
                    regard it as improbable that any definite action will be taken within two
                    weeks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
